<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">A. Dubey, A. Jauhri, A. Pandey, A. Kadian, A. Al-Dahle, A. Letman, A. Mathur, A. Schelten, A. Yang, A. Fan, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span>
