<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Dataset Distribution Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix A Dataset Distribution Details ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> illustrates the topic distribution of the 30k collected human-authored slides used to guide our instruction generation process.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix A Dataset Distribution Details ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> depicts the topic distribution of the curated instructions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Dataset Distribution Details ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows the domain distribution of the instructions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2601.09487v1/figures/industry_pie.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/317;" width="476" height="317" alt="Refer to caption">
