<section id="A5.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.1.2 </span>Stage 2: Initial Parameter Selection</h4>

<div id="A5.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Based on the empirical distributions (Figures <a href="#A5.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ E.4 ColorHarmonyMetric Parameters ‣ Appendix E Aesthetic Metrics Parameter Tuning ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>–<a href="#A5.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ E.2 SubbandEntropyMetric Parameters ‣ Appendix E Aesthetic Metrics Parameter Tuning ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>), we established initial parameter values capturing professionally designed slide characteristics.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS1.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">E.1.3 </span>Stage 3: Human Preference Optimization</h4>

<div id="A5.SS1.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We constructed a verification set of 50 slide pairs with human preference rankings. Using Bayesian optimization, we tuned parameters to maximize Spearman correlation (<math id="A5.SS1.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math>) between metric scores and human rankings.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>SubbandEntropyMetric Parameters</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Subband Entropy metric measures visual clutter through steerable pyramid decomposition <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rosenholtz et al. (2007)</a></cite>. The metric decomposes images in CIE-LAB color space and computes Shannon entropy across subbands:</p>
<table id="A5.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="SE=w_{L}\bar{H}_{L}+w_{ab}\bar{H}_{a}+w_{ab}\bar{H}_{b}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">SE=w_{L}\bar{H}_{L}+w_{ab}\bar{H}_{a}+w_{ab}\bar{H}_{b}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{H}_{c}=\frac{1}{N_{c}}\sum_{i=1}^{N_{c}}H(S_{c}^{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></msubsup><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{H}_{c}=\frac{1}{N_{c}}\sum_{i=1}^{N_{c}}H(S_{c}^{i})</annotation></semantics></math> is the average entropy across subbands for channel <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>, with adaptive binning (bins <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=\sqrt{|S|}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=\sqrt{|S|}</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>SubbandEntropyMetric Parameters</figcaption>
<table id="A5.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Param</span></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T8.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sym</span></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Val</span></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T8.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rationale</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Lum. Weight</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{L}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">0.84</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">From <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rosenholtz et al. (2007)</a></cite>; luminance dominates clutter perception</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Chrom. Weight</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{ab}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{ab}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">0.08</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Equal weight per channel; <math id="A5.T8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum w=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum w=1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Pyramid Levels</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">3</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Multi-scale without excess computation</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Orientations</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">4</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Standard config (0°, 45°, 90°, 135°)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Zero Thresh.</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">0.008</td>
