<span id="A5.T8.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Low-variation channels ignored</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A5.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ E.2 SubbandEntropyMetric Parameters ‣ Appendix E Aesthetic Metrics Parameter Tuning ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows the distribution with mean 3.878 bits, aligning with structured presentation content.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2601.09487v1/figures/output_plots/subband_entropy_mean.png" id="A5.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/317;" width="476" height="317" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Distribution of Subband Entropy scores (<math id="A5.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu=3.878" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.878</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu=3.878</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>ColorfulnessMetric Parameters</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Colorfulness metric quantifies chromatic variety using the Hasler &amp; Süsstrunk method <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib15" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hasler and Suesstrunk (2003)</a></cite>:</p>
<table id="A5.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\sqrt{\sigma_{rg}^{2}+\sigma_{yb}^{2}}+0.3\sqrt{\mu_{rg}^{2}+\mu_{yb}^{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\sqrt{\sigma_{rg}^{2}+\sigma_{yb}^{2}}+0.3\sqrt{\mu_{rg}^{2}+\mu_{yb}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="rg=R-G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">rg=R-G</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="yb=0.5(R+G)-B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">yb=0.5(R+G)-B</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The coefficient <math id="A5.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.3</annotation></semantics></math> was empirically derived through psychophysical experiments, balancing chromatic spread (<math id="A5.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>) and bias (<math id="A5.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>μ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu</annotation></semantics></math>). Figure <a href="#A5.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ E.3 ColorfulnessMetric Parameters ‣ Appendix E Aesthetic Metrics Parameter Tuning ‣ SlidesGen-Bench: Evaluating Slides Generation via Computational and Quantitative Metrics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows professional slides exhibit moderate colorfulness (<math id="A5.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu=51.09" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>51.09</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu=51.09</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2601.09487v1/figures/output_plots/colorfulness_mean.png" id="A5.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/317;" width="476" height="317" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Colorfulness distribution (<math id="A5.F9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu\approx 50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu\approx 50</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.F9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma=27.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma=27.7</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>ColorHarmonyMetric Parameters</h3>

<div id="A5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Color Harmony metric evaluates adherence to harmonic color templates <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cohen-Or et al. (2006)</a></cite>. For each pixel <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math> with hue <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{p}</annotation></semantics></math> and saturation <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A5.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\text{template}}(\alpha)=\frac{\sum_{p}S_{p}\cdot d(H_{p},T_{\alpha})}{\sum_{p}S_{p}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>template</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\text{template}}(\alpha)=\frac{\sum_{p}S_{p}\cdot d(H_{p},T_{\alpha})}{\sum_{p}S_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d(H_{p},T_{\alpha})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d(H_{p},T_{\alpha})</annotation></semantics></math> is the angular distance to template <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> rotated by <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>. The slide score uses Gaussian decay:</p>
<table id="A5.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="S_{\text{slide}}=\exp\left(-\bar{D}^{2}/2\sigma^{2}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>slide</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\text{slide}}=\exp\left(-\bar{D}^{2}/2\sigma^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Harmonic Templates (center, width as fractions of 360°)</figcaption>
<table id="A5.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Type</span></td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sectors</span></td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Desc.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">i</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.05)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Monochromatic</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">V</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.26)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Analogous</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">L</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.05), (0.25, 0.22)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Split-comp.</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">I</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.05), (0.50, 0.05)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Complementary</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">T</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0.25, 0.50)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Triadic</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Y</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.26), (0.50, 0.05)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Split-comp. var.</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T9.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T9.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">X</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">(0, 0.26), (0.50, 0.26)</td>
<td id="A5.T9.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Double comp.</td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>ColorHarmonyMetric Parameters</figcaption>
<table id="A5.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Param</span></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T10.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sym</span></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><span id="A5.T10.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Val</span></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T10.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rationale</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Gaussian <math id="A5.T10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">0.0005</td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Strictness; optimized via human pref.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T10.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Angular Res.</td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">360</td>
