<span id="A5.T10.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Full-degree granularity</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T10.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">Sat. Thresh.</td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"><math id="A5.T10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\min}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\min}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">0.1</td>
<td id="A5.T10.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A5.T10.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Exclude achromatic pixels</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A5.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Deck-Level Scoring:</span></p>
<table id="A5.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Score}=5\mu_{\text{deck}}-30\sigma_{\text{deck}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>deck</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>deck</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Score}=5\mu_{\text{deck}}-30\sigma_{\text{deck}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS4.p2.2" class="ltx_p">rewarding high average harmony while penalizing inconsistency.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2601.09487v1/figures/output_plots/color_harmony_mean_distance.png" id="A5.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/317;" width="476" height="317" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Color Harmony distance distribution (<math id="A5.F10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{D}=0.202" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0.202</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{D}=0.202</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.5 </span>VisualHRVMetric Parameters</h3>

<div id="A5.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Visual HRV metric assesses presentation pacing by measuring variability across consecutive slides, inspired by physiological HRV analysis <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">van Ravenswaaij-Arts et al. (1993)</a></cite>. Given normalized scores <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{S_{1},\ldots,S_{n}\}\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{S_{1},\ldots,S_{n}\}\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A5.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{RMSSD}=\sqrt{\frac{1}{n-1}\sum_{i=1}^{n-1}|S_{i+1}-S_{i}|^{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RMSSD</mtext><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{RMSSD}=\sqrt{\frac{1}{n-1}\sum_{i=1}^{n-1}|S_{i+1}-S_{i}|^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Overload detection uses moving average <math id="A5.SS5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{S}_{j}^{(w)}=\frac{1}{w}\sum_{k=0}^{w-1}S_{j+k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{S}_{j}^{(w)}=\frac{1}{w}\sum_{k=0}^{w-1}S_{j+k}</annotation></semantics></math>. The final score:</p>
<table id="A5.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Score}=100\left(1-\frac{|\text{RMSSD}-\tau|}{\tau_{w}}\right)-p\cdot N_{\text{overload}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mtext>RMSSD</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>overload</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Score}=100\left(1-\frac{|\text{RMSSD}-\tau|}{\tau_{w}}\right)-p\cdot N_{\text{overload}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
